            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "Added usage examples in comments to show cases where gpioget fails due to\nbusy GPIO lines and how the fallback helper can still read the level.\n\n```shell\nroot@bmc:~# gpioget $(gpiofind AALC_RPU_READY)\ngpioget: error reading GPIO values: Device or resource busy\nroot@bmc:~# gpioget $(gpiofind PWRGD_P5V_AUX_R2)\ngpioget: error reading GPIO values: Device or resource busy\n\nroot@bmc:~# source /usr/libexec/fb-common-functions\nroot@bmc:~# get_gpio_allow_busy AALC_RPU_READY\nDB_INFO:  gpio-892 (AALC_RPU_READY      |gpio_monitor        ) in  lo IRQ\n0\nroot@bmc:~# get_gpio_allow_busy PWRGD_P5V_AUX_R2\nDB_INFO:  gpio-2660 (PWRGD_P5V_AUX_R2    |gpio_monitor        ) in  hi IRQ\n1\n```"
                }
            ],
